A comment-only braced paragraph after a blank closes the item it misses

```
- a

{%%}

  z
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<p>z</p>
```

```
- a
  - b

   {%%}
    - b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li><p>b</p></li>
      <li><p>b</p></li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  {%%}

  z
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <p>z</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
